# A road at night (synthetic, invented): the Tarnished rides between two places, losing a run of snapshots on the way,
# meets two hounds, talks to someone at a popup, is joined by another player (the gate closes, and opens again 5 s after
# they leave) and goes back to the title. Our own route, names and numbers.
route road-and-gate
seed 5
step 250
end 52000

at 0     spawn player hp=900/900 pos=0,0,0
at 0     place 63001
at 1000  ride on
at 3000  move player to=120,0,0 over=12000
at 6000  place 63002
at 6500  drop_snapshots 6
at 12000 spawn howl team=6 pos=130,4,0 hp=250/250
at 12000 spawn yelp team=6 pos=131,-3,0 hp=250/250
at 14000 hit howl -> player dmg=60
at 15000 ride off
at 15500 kill howl by=player
at 16000 hit player -> yelp dmg=120
at 16500 kill yelp by=player
at 20000 place 63001
at 26000 place 63002
at 24000 talk on
at 27000 talk off
at 30000 session coop
at 36000 session solo
at 50000 title

# What the route must show (ARCH §8.4, §8.8, §9): a place stable across a run of dropped snapshots fires once; a place
# entered again within 10 min of play is deduplicated; an attack from beyond 20 m is unseen; the gate's changes.
expect count 1 PlaceEntered place_id=63002
expect event PlaceEntered place_id=63001 prev=63002 within 22000..22000
expect event Struck subject=player unseen=true att=none within 14000..14000
expect event AllyDied victim=howl witnesses=[yelp]
expect count 1 AllyDied
expect event NativeTalkStarted popup=true within 24000..24000
expect event NativeTalkEnded held_ms=3000 within 27000..27000
expect event GateChanged active=false within 30000..30000
expect event GateChanged active=true within 41000..41000
expect event TitleReached within 50000..50000
expect count 2 MountChanged
